---
title: Kumpulan Catatan Riza
description: Kumpulan artikel dan catatan tentang pemrograman, teknologi, AI, Elixir, dan web development oleh Riza Fahmi
layout: main
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<main id="main-content" class="container">
    <div class="articles-header">
      <h2>CATATAN</h2>
      <div class="rss-pill">
        🔔 FEED: <a href="/feed.xml" target="_blank">RSS</a> / <a href="/feed/full.xml" target="_blank">FULL</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="articles">
      {% for article in collections.catatan | reverse %}
      <article class="article">
        <div class="article-meta-row">
          <span>📅 {{ article.date | dateToISO }}</span>
          <span>⏱️ {{ article.content | readingTime }}</span>
          {%- if goatcounterViews and goatcounterViews[article.url] %}
          <span>🔥 {{ goatcounterViews[article.url] | localeString }} DIBACA</span>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        <h3>
          <a href="{{article.url}}">{{ article.data.title }}</a>
        </h3>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    
    <a class="back" href="/">&lt; KEMBALI KE BERANDA</a>
</main>
